@@ -9,6 +9,20 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Preserved navigation views
+
+The shared layout retains up to five rendered content views during client-side
+navigation, keyed by pathname and query string. Returning to a cached route reuses
+its live DOM and React islands. Inactive views use `content-visibility: hidden`,
+are inert, and are excluded from the accessibility tree. Browsers without
+`content-visibility` support hide inactive views with `display: none`.
+
+The least recently used view is removed when the cache fills. Sign-in, sign-up,
+and error pages opt out with `<Layout cacheView={false}>`. The cache lasts for
+the current document only; a full reload clears it. Astro still fetches each
+navigation and updates the document head, but cached content keeps its previous
+state until eviction or reload.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
